WEBVTT

00:00:00.135 --> 00:00:02.724
Create a private gable shed. WindLab opens with the saved roof dimensions.

00:00:02.724 --> 00:00:06.848
Select the east face and a training topographic multiplier of 1.20. Regional speeds are 40 and 28 metres per second.

00:00:06.848 --> 00:00:13.040
Apply the reviewed case. The server reconstructs pressures for the saved shed geometry.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:18.242
Review the east windward wall at +1.106 kPa ultimate and the west wall at −0.968 kPa. Service pressures are listed separately.

00:00:18.242 --> 00:00:32.269
Inspect longitudinal wind force and strap demand, then read the scoped portal checks. Final approval remains with the engineer.

00:00:32.269 --> 00:00:37.011
Reopen WindLab from the saved project to recover the selected face, terrain factors and coefficients.
